<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<style>
html { background: #ffffff; }
body {
  width: 720pt; height: 405pt; margin: 0; padding: 0;
  background: #F4F6F6;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  display: flex;
}
.header {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
  height: 70pt;
  background: #1C2833;
  padding: 20pt 40pt;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.header h1 {
  font-size: 28pt;
  color: #F4F6F6;
  margin: 0;
}
.content {
  margin: 90pt 40pt 50pt 40pt;
}
.section {
  margin-bottom: 25pt;
}
h2 {
  font-size: 20pt;
  color: #D4AF37;
  margin: 0 0 10pt 0;
  font-weight: bold;
}
ul {
  margin: 0;
  padding-left: 30pt;
  font-size: 16pt;
  color: #2E4053;
  line-height: 1.6;
}
.highlight {
  background: #D4AF37;
  padding: 15pt 20pt;
  border-radius: 8pt;
  margin-top: 15pt;
}
.highlight p {
  font-size: 16pt;
  color: #1C2833;
  margin: 0;
  font-weight: bold;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="header">
  <h1>黄金：避险之王，再创新高</h1>
</div>
<div class="content">
  <div class="section">
    <h2>驱动因素</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>地缘政治不确定性</li>
      <li>央行持续购金</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="section">
    <h2>市场表现</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>紫金矿业等龙头业绩强劲</li>
      <li>金价中枢上移</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="highlight">
    <p>投资策略：建议作为组合底仓，对冲波动风险</p>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
